OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy for many, with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, mainly in the west, and some
OL,7,Fheavier bursts across the far north of
OL,8,FScotland. Sunny spells will develop
OL,9,Ffrom the west, while showers affect
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland, Scotland and
OL,11,Fnorthern England. Feeling slightly
OL,12,Fcooler.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FSome sunny spells will linger
OL,15,Facross the far south this evening, but
OL,16,Fcloud will thicken from the west, with
OL,17,Foutbreaks of drizzle developing across
OL,18,Fmuch of England and Wales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
