OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRain will soon clear the
OL,6,Ffar southeast, with sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping widely. Heavy, frequent
OL,8,Fshowers across Scotland will spread
OL,9,Fmore widely through the day, with some
OL,10,Fpotentially turning thundery.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
